  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIFBS Disaster Relief Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pitch In For Baseball &amp; Softball (PIFBS) reduces barriers to play and promotes youth development by donating baseball/softball equipment in underserved communities. In times of tragedy, children are the most affected. Baseball and softball can help to restore a sense of normalcy amidst the chaos. This projects seeks to raise funds to help PIFBS build reserves of equipment to increase organizational efficiency in response to natural disasters such as Hurricane Idalia and the Maui wildfires.</narrative>
  </description>
